# Google OAuth Client ID (Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials
# -> Create Credentials -> OAuth client ID -> Web application).
#
# Add these to "Authorized JavaScript origins":
#   http://localhost:5173
#   https://your-app.vercel.app
#
# No client secret is needed — this app only uses Google Identity Services'
# client-side sign-in button (a signed ID token), never a server-side
# OAuth exchange. That's what makes it possible to ship with no backend.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
